{
"note_claim": "Persona 3 Reload's UI theme reflects the original design intent and symbolizes the Sea of Souls and seaside locations like Port Island.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "In P3R, I imagined combining the beauty of the sea from Port Island and Yakushima in the game, with the protagonist's \"Sea of Souls.\"",
"reason": "The developer interview explicitly confirms the UI design was intended to combine the sea from Port Island with the Sea of Souls concept."
}
